{"text": "hesitation", "etymologies": [{"etymologyHTML": "<p>From Latin <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"la\">haesit\u0101ti\u014dnem</i>, accusative singular of <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"la\">haesit\u0101ti\u014d</i> (\u201chesitating, stammering\u201d), from <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"la\">haesit\u014d</i> (\u201chesitate\u201d). Displaced native Old English <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"ang\">\u0121ewand</i>.\n</p>", "pos": [{"pos": "Noun", "definitions": [{"definition": "An act of hesitating", "quote": [], "relative": {}}, {"definition": "Doubt; vacillation.\n", "quote": [], "relative": {}}, {"definition": "A faltering in speech; stammering.", "quote": [], "relative": {}}]}]}], "pronunciation": [["UK, US", "/h\u025bz\u026a\u02c8te\u026a\u0283\u0259n/"]]}